          "id": "954539db-dcbd-4299-97fc-326aa6478972",
          "memory": "On October 10, 2026 User finally watered User's houseplants after they looked droopy, feeling guilty, with Maya calling it a redemption arc.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "ec461f51-4a6a-437e-9283-ac5a7f5a5b66",
          "memory": "As of October 10, 2026 Maya's miracle basil plant was still alive after Maya moved it from the dark kitchen to the windowsill for more sun.",
