        },
        {
          "id": "273dd3cb-b9bb-4da1-a01a-09e8efef41bd",
          "memory": "User said User's kitchen is too dark like Maya's and thinks that is why User's houseplants are always sad.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "f6705354-aafd-4096-b682-a7b835c6a76b",
          "memory": "As of October 10, 2026 Maya's sister still had not signed up for pottery and was still saying someday, with User joking to tell the Tuesday guy she's still thinking about it.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "dfb5c395-9e08-4849-9485-b8a21ab3ce26",
          "memory": "Maya's sister is planning a birthday pizza outing with about 6 friends at Rosa's at 4 pm next Saturday, October 17, 2026, with Maya clarifying it is just her sister's crew and neither Maya nor User is going.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "49e0b5e9-6d77-486d-aeaa-06746c14fe93",
          "memory": "For Rosa's pizza, Maya and User's iconic order advice for Maya's sister includes getting garlic knots, ordering a half order to start to save room, asking for patio seating if nice, remembering the knot plus salad balance, with User as wobbly chair safety expert, and agreeing Rosa's is much better than Luigi's after Maya's menu confusion last week.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "f176650c-3ad4-470b-8e83-cbd42543999c",
          "memory": "On October 10, 2026 User finally watched the chaotic baking show with the mop-like cake that Maya sent, calling it unhinged that someone made a cake look like cleaning supplies, but perfect background noise, while Maya was rewatching it while avoiding laundry.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "da904081-bbce-49a6-afea-8f464bdec538",
          "memory": "On the afternoon of October 10, 2026 Maya was avoiding folding laundry while stuck on the couch and added to her unfolded chair pile, with User joking the chair pile lives on.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "13b6e530-e2f0-4114-a6f8-30eee4cf4cad",
          "memory": "At Tuesday pottery in the week of October 6, 2026 User made something that might be a mug, described as a lopsided mug to match the wavy bowl for a full set of functional art.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "167ee558-b7f1-4f18-9121-726f644f834c",
          "memory": "Maya said she needs her sister to join pottery so Maya has an excuse to come too, and User invited them to do October pottery together to all be messy together.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "00893e00-11bf-43b2-8fc9-dc43cf6fbf7e",
          "memory": "On Saturday afternoon October 10, 2026 User and Maya were both trapped in couch rot, with User waking from a couch nap more tired, User staying in blanket mode and possibly ordering in later, while Maya planned canned tomato soup with grilled cheese because it was chilly with the window open and perfect soup weather.",
